        <mxCell id="boundary" value="Only an authorised incident responder may stop unsafe access. This does not complete a switch or customer exit.&#10;Every path keeps evidence and names who will finish earlier work. SPEC032 §1 defines customer scenarios OFF-S01–10.&#10;A listed scenario does not confirm feature availability. Private-to-private switching remains disabled in current onboarding scope." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
